{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は世の中どこを見ても\nハロウィン一色！というくらいに\nハロウィン文化が広まってて\nびっくり(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"数年前はこんなに仮装とかも\n豊富じゃなかったよなぁと\nしみじみ思います♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コスプレ好きにはもってこいの\n季節ですな〜(。-ω-)｡°｡°｡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でみんなハロウィンの\n仮装をしててたくさんツーショットを\n撮ったのでみなさんにも\nおすそ分けでずっヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒猫まいやん×小悪魔まなつ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/10/21/1841319/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高めツインテールおそろい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんが私のクッキーを\n食べたがってくれてたから\n今度作るの∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナースさゆりん×小悪魔まなつ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/10/21/1841319/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ？ま・ナース？！と\nたくさん言われたらしい（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確かに似てる〜(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒猫ゆみちゃん×小悪魔まなつ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/10/21/1841319/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日も一昨日もわかとごはん一緒に\n食べに行ったよ〜(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のわかの髪の長さがすごく好き♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小悪魔かずみん×小悪魔まなつ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/10/21/1841319/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしげもなく着替え部屋から\nコスプレに着替えて出てきた私と\n恥ずかしがって壁の影に\n隠れて出て来れなかったかずみん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年でも\n対照的ですねー(人-ω-)♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもその隠れてるかずみんが\nすごく可愛かったので\n引っ張り出しにいきました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イクタリアン×小悪魔まなつ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/10/21/1841319/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イクタリアンがちょくちょく\n私のレーンに遊びに来たよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前お仕事の待ち時間に\n超能力研究部ごっこを\n2人でしました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"といっても、天井を眺めて\nボソボソボソボソ\nUFOのことを話すだけ(。-ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにやるんだけど\n大抵こういう時は\nいくちゃんが急に始めます♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだあるからまたちょくちょく\n載せて行くね(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13th特典映像の個人PVの\n予告が公開になりました(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の私の個人PVは\nドラマ仕立ての恋愛もの♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもただのラブストーリーではなく\n秘密が散りばめられています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予告で気づける方、いるかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PM8:00「真夏」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://youtu.be/pKIM7hF71jY"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感想待ってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったらチェックして\n見てくださーい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハロウィンのこと書いてたら\nカボチャが食べたくなって\nパンプキンパイ食べながら\nこのブログ書きました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあまたねっ♡"}],"source":"archive"}